<mxCell id="note" value="For each token t: z[t] = QACT(bfinal + Σⱼ X⁽ᴷ⁾[t,j] Wfinal[j]). Output z is stored as [M,N], t=mN+n.&lt;br&gt;One score per token; positive favors bit 1, negative favors bit 0. Scores are not probabilities; no sigmoid or threshold is used.&lt;br&gt;Shared linear owns the logit write. Stage 5 starts only after all L writes finish." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
